From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan <ryan@esterlines.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 23:44:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] LibWeb: Farble canvas script readback with HMAC-SHA256

Noise only the copy handed to script (getImageData, toDataURL, toBlob,
OffscreenCanvas convertToBlob, transferToImageBitmap, createImageBitmap
from a canvas). Displayed and compositor bitmaps stay untouched.
